Lizard - 1.2.1
--------------

http://www.darkarts.co.za/projects/lizard/

This is the first release of this graphical interface for NetHack and
SLASH'EM.  It is based on the Ne.W.T interface (
http://www.darkarts.co.za/projects/newt/ ) and extends this interface
with several of my own visual (and other) enhancements.  This is a
non-vanilla NetHack/SLASH'EM with several patches applied.

some notable patches applied include:
	darkroom
	passages
	line of sight (ascii and tiled)
	monster moves


ChangeLog
---------

   * fix the 'sleeping gas trap' bug


